# The SPA build, copied in by @rockysurf/web's build (scripts/sync-web-bundle.mjs). Generated,
# never committed. The two siblings are that script's swap scratch, left behind only if it is
# interrupted mid-copy.
public/
public.build/
public.prev/
# The repository's `packs/`, copied in by this package's own build
# (scripts/sync-packs-bundle.mjs) so the published tarball ships them (rockysurf-io02).
# Generated, never committed — the source of truth is `packs/` at the repository root.
#
# LEADING SLASH, and it is load-bearing rather than tidy. A bare `packs/` matches a directory of
# that name at ANY depth, which includes `src/packs/` — the pack loader's own source directory.
# Written unanchored, this silently excluded a new file there from a commit, and the branch went
# up with an import of a module that was not in it. Anchor to the package root, where the
# generated directory actually is.
/packs/
/packs.build/
/packs.prev/
